  "rationale": "RigProvider constructs Rig Bedrock and native Ollama completion models behind one completion interface; the same harness supplies prompts and tools. Local HTTP tests exercise both concrete adapters, exact model IDs, native Ollama options/authentication, and signed Bedrock Converse requests without cloud access.",
